{"id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-oracle-rules.md","title":"Effective Enumeration of Oracle Rules","display":"df-oracle-rules — Effective Enumeration of Oracle Rules","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-oracle-rules","aliases":["88-df-oracle-rules"],"display":"df-oracle-rules — Effective Enumeration of Oracle Rules","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-oracle-rules"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-oracle-rules</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-oracle-rules — Effective Enumeration of Oracle Rules"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N}\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}}\">\\(2^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N}\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}}\\)</span> 是有限二进制初段的集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为其元素。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s,j,x,y,u,z\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s,j,x,y,u,z\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\">\\(\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\">\\(\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\)</span> 是本文件定义的初段、相容和与神谕一致关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a> 的固定定义性编码函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\">\\(\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的规则数码。对长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 的初段，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(\\ell-1))\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(\\ell-1))\\)</span>，空初段使用空元组码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"63bffa02095213d3\" href=\"?note=63bffa02095213d3\" title=\"88-df-ce-indexing\">88-df-ce-indexing</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(F\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为候选规则图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{e,s}\">\\(B_{e,s}\\)</span> 是已接纳的有限规则集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{e,s,j}\">\\(B_{e,s,j}\\)</span> 是阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 内扫描前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个数码后的临时集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_e\">\\(F_e\\)</span> 是经有效冲突筛选及初段扩张闭包得到的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 个规则图。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\;\n\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(\\sigma(i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in A),\\\\\n\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{enc}(\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma),x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\;\n\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(\\sigma(i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in A),\\\\\n\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{enc}(\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma),x,y).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\{\\rho(\\sigma,x,y):\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land\\langle\\tau,x,z\\rangle\\in F\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to y=z\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\n\\to\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nF\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\{\\rho(\\sigma,x,y):\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land\\langle\\tau,x,z\\rangle\\in F\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to y=z\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\n\\to\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nB_{e,0}\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad B_{e,s,0}\\coloneqq B_{e,s}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nB_{e,0}\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad B_{e,s,0}\\coloneqq B_{e,s}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall j&lt;s\\quad\nB_{e,s,j+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,j}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n&amp;j\\in W_{e,s}\\land j=\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle\\tau,u,z\\rangle\\in B_{e,s,j}\\;\n(u=x\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to z=y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall j&lt;s\\quad\nB_{e,s,j+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,j}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n&amp;j\\in W_{e,s}\\land j=\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\langle\\tau,u,z\\rangle\\in B_{e,s,j}\\;\n(u=x\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to z=y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;B_{e,s+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,s}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;B_{e,s+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,s}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nF_e\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nF_e\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个数码最多解成一条规则，且合法码识别、解码、有限相容性检查均有效。阶段内按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=0,\\ldots,s-1\">\\(j=0,\\ldots,s-1\\)</span> 扫描，故没有“同时接纳两条互相冲突规则”的歧义。已接纳规则不撤回；不合法的数码和会产生冲突的候选规则被忽略。最后对有限神谕条件取向上闭包，正式补出收敛对初段扩张的单调性。</p>\n<p>不能先列出全部 c.e. 规则集，再通过一个不可判定的全局合法性测试筛掉坏索引。本构造直接把<strong>每个</strong>自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 有效变成一个合法功能规则图；枚举的正确性、满性和一致可枚举性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8c35cc87b3063540\" href=\"?note=8c35cc87b3063540\" title=\"88-lem-oracle-enumeration\">88-lem-oracle-enumeration</a> 给出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-indexing]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定定义性编码函数；$\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)$ 是本文件定义的规则数码。对长度为 $\\ell$ 的初段，$\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma)$ 缩写 $\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(\\ell-1))$，空初段使用空元组码。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-indexing","status":"resolved","id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$W_{e,s}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-indexing]]；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[88-df-ce-set]]。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-oracle-enumeration","status":"resolved","id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"不能先列出全部 c.e. 规则集，再通过一个不可判定的全局合法性测试筛掉坏索引。本构造直接把**每个**自然数 $e$ 有效变成一个合法功能规则图；枚举的正确性、满性和一致可枚举性由 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]] 给出。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"2^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{\\ell\\in\\mathbb N}\\{0,1\\}^{\\{0,\\ldots,\\ell-1\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"e,s,j,x,y,u,z\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(\\ell-1))","display":false},{"tex":"W_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"B_{e,s}","display":false},{"tex":"B_{e,s,j}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"F_e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\subseteq\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)\\;\n\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i),\\\\\n\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(\\sigma(i)=1\\leftrightarrow i\\in A),\\\\\n\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\coloneqq{}&\\mathrm{enc}(\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma),x,y).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nF\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\{\\rho(\\sigma,x,y):\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y,z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\land\\langle\\tau,x,z\\rangle\\in F\n\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to y=z\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\Bigl(\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau\\land\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in F\n\\to\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in F\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nB_{e,0}\\coloneqq\\emptyset,\\qquad B_{e,s,0}\\coloneqq B_{e,s}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall j<s\\quad\nB_{e,s,j+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,j}\\cup\n\\{\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n&j\\in W_{e,s}\\land j=\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\langle\\tau,u,z\\rangle\\in B_{e,s,j}\\;\n(u=x\\land\\mathrm{Compatible}(\\sigma,\\tau)\\to z=y)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e,s\\in\\mathbb N\\;B_{e,s+1}\\coloneqq B_{e,s,s}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}oracle\\text{-}rules}\\vdash\n\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nF_e\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle\\tau,x,y\\rangle\\in2^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N^2:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\n(\\langle\\sigma,x,y\\rangle\\in B_{e,s}\\land\\sigma\\preccurlyeq\\tau)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"j=0,\\ldots,s-1","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false}],"bytes":4162,"backlinks":[{"id":"63bffa02095213d3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"最后一个等价式由 c.e. 集的定义域刻画和有效编号的满性推出。神谕规则的数码可以作为某个 $W_e$ 的元素，但把数码解成规则、排除冲突、补全扩张闭包是另一个构造，见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。"},{"id":"baf8d9aebf7edfa1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s}$ 与 $\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；枚举的单值性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"47142c2c72e0fb46","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e$ 及 $\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}(F)$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；该谓词同时规定有效可枚举性、相容条件上的单值性与初段扩张单调性。"},{"id":"8c35cc87b3063540","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e,B_{e,s},\\rho,\\mathrm{FunctionalRules}$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]。"},{"id":"c24d037bf910fb4b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e,\\rho$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]；其一致有效枚举及满性见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"32064e6d9e6f371a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi_e^A,\\varphi_{e,s}^A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-computation]]；$B_{e,s}$、$\\sigma\\sqsubseteq A$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，其中 $B_{e,s}$ 是规则近似而不是本定理目标集合 $B$ 的阶段近似。"},{"id":"3d14d294ed1b6514","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F_e$ 见 [[88-df-oracle-rules]]，合法规则图的实现见 [[88-lem-oracle-enumeration]]。"